  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "Prices for ingredients are sky-high again, man. I\u2019m barely making
      a profit this week."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "Everything is getting expensive, Lan. It\u2019s not just your stall."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Easy for you to say! You just ride around. I have to balance these books
      while people complain about a few extra cents for sauce.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "Well, if it makes you feel better, my bike is eating more gas than I\u2019m
      eating rice."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 5
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 5
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "At least we\u2019re both struggling in style, then. This economy is going
      to be the death of me!"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
